A. Transactin-Processor-Service Transaction Steps

	I. Technical-Service Transaction Request
		1. Receive transaction object from Technical-Service
		2. For each transaction;
			i. Do some field validations
			ii. If pass, CONTINUE, otherwise return FAILURE: Validation Error
		3. Save the transaction in the DB table
		4. Prepare Gag Tranasction Object
		5. Send request to GAG

		
B. Technical-Service Transaction Respose
	1. Receive response from GAG Service
	2. Return response to Technical-Service
	3. On a different thread, save the transaction Statuses